.TH TOON-MCP 1 "November 2026" "toon-mcp 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
toon-mcp-server, toon-mcp \- FastMCP server for Token-Optimized Object Notation (TOON)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B toon-mcp-server
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B toon-mcp-server
is a pure Python FastMCP server providing high-efficiency Token-Optimized Object
Notation (TOON) compression, decompression, pattern analysis, and token savings
metrics for LLM contexts over standard input/output.
.PP
For automatic terminal paste compression in interactive CLI tools, see
.BR toon-wrap (1).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show summary of options and exit.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show version information and exit.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR toon-wrap (1),
.BR mcp (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Maintained by Vikyek <https://github.com/Vikyek>.
